Hi, I'm Pepple Victor.

Welcome to my Data Analytics Portfolio.

This repository showcases my end-to-end data analytics projects, where I transform raw data into actionable business insights using Microsoft Excel, SQL, Python, and Power BI. Each project follows a complete analytics workflow, including data cleaning, exploratory data analysis (EDA), dashboard development, executive reporting, and business recommendations.

My goal is to build practical, business-focused analytics solutions that demonstrate both technical expertise and the ability to communicate insights effectively to stakeholders.

Thank you for taking the time to explore my work. I hope you enjoy following my journey as I continue to grow as a data analyst.
